description: Check this Anetos app's security and fix what the check finds - SQL, HTML, redirects or commands built from request data, routes without CSRF or a login, unsafe settings, secrets in files, vulnerable dependencies, the running site. Use when asked about security, before a release or deploy, or when a check reports a security finding.
